&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a team of Strategy &amp;amp; Operations ICs through coaching, prioritization, and vision setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Personally own key initiatives in Europe: identify opportunities that move company metrics, align cross-functional teams, remove roadblocks, and lead execution end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Prioritize GTM and Product initiatives based on impact, strategic importance, and complexity, and partner with Data Science to build and refine the models that support those decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proactively identify opportunities that grow retailer lifetime value (LTV)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Drive forecasting, performance monitoring, and metric decomps, and surface the insights that matter most to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build effective, scalable operational processes and close operational gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with key stakeholders across Product, Operations, Revenue, and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in consulting, finance (investment banking or private equity), or analytical business operations roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience managing and developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Some experience partnering with GTM and Product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are an exceptional creative problem solver. You can break down ambiguous problems and structure a path to an answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are analytical and comfortable with data. You have strong analytical thinking and SQL knowledge, or the willingness to learn it quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You have strong product and business intuition. You can place insights in the context of broader business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are a scrappy, resourceful executor. When something needs to get done, you remove roadblocks and find a way to make it happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are highly collaborative and influence effectively through others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are a clear, structured communicator, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You have a strong work ethic and an ownership mindset, and you stay calm and perform under pressure and tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You embrace the adventure and do whatever it takes to ensure success&lt;/li&gt;
