&lt;p&gt;Faire is a community of independent retailers and the brands they buy from, and our offices are where the people serving that community do their work. The Head of Workplace owns our real estate and workplace strategy across San Francisco, Toronto, Waterloo, New York, and London. You&#39;ll run the basics well (safe, clean, cost-conscious spaces) and make sure people feel connected to each other and to our community of retailers and brands. You&#39;ll lead the Workplace and Security team and partner closely with Finance, People, IT, and Security. This role reports to the Chief People Officer and is office-aligned in San Francisco.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Real estate and portfolio&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own portfolio strategy, including capacity planning, site selection, lease negotiations, renewals, and capital needs, based on headcount plans and utilization data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases and investment recommendations that balance employee experience, cost, and flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our hybrid work policies using internal data and external trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mission and connection&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring Faire&#39;s mission into our spaces, for example by showcasing the brands we work with, hosting retailers, or building rituals that keep employees close to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; build in-office programs people actually want to show up for, and use employee feedback to keep improving it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operations, vendors, and safety&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
