&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years of experience designing digital products and systems. &lt;/strong&gt;Your previous work demonstrates an attention to detail and high quality visual, UX, systems design, and content design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in interaction design, visual craft, and systems thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to connect design direction to business and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort exploring and experimenting with new tools and workflows for rapid prototyping and AI-integrated design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; that demonstrates visionary product thinking, strong craft, and clear communication of impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to and evolving large-scale design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for collaboration and driving a culture of excellence in design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And, ideally, a sense of humor!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
