&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Faire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faire is a technology wholesale platform built on the belief that the future is local. Independent retailers around the globe collectively represent a multi-hundred-billion-dollar wholesale market that has historically been fragmented and offline. At Faire, we&#39;re using the power of tech, data, and machine learning to connect this thriving community of entrepreneurs across the globe. Picture your favorite boutique in town — we help them discover the best products from around the world to sell in their stores. With the right tools and insights, we believe that we can level the playing field so businesses can grow and local communities can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for smart, resourceful and passionate people to join us as we power the shop local movement. If you believe in community, come join ours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Strategy &amp;amp; Analytics Senior Director to lead our Discovery pillar. Our Discovery pillar focuses on the core shopping experience — helping retailers find the right products and brands through search, recommendations, ads, and exploration while balancing marketplace dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Discovery S&amp;amp;A Pillar lead, you’ll level up the Discovery pillar through analytics, both strategically and operationally. You will inform the pillar&#39;s most important decisions as a strategic thought partner, operationalize analytics through thoughtful systems, and take extreme ownership of key company-wide datasets and metrics. You will build and lead a high-performing S&amp;amp;A team that delivers these with exceptional strategic clarity, analytical rigor, and ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategic decisions at the pillar level.&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a trusted member of Discovery pillar leadership to inform the pillar’s most important decisions through pillar-level analysis, leveling up pod work, identifying white space opportunities, and connecting the dots across pods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build, manage, and level up the Discovery S&amp;amp;A team.&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit, coach, and grow an all star S&amp;amp;A team. Set a clear bar and vision to develop ICs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own offensive and defensive tracking for key company and Discovery metrics.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive a reporting drumbeat key metrics so we catch issues early, know when to decomp, and proactively identify opportunities to move them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the standard for analytical rigor across Discovery.&lt;/strong&gt; Raise the bar on how the pillar uses data to make decisions. Set and uphold experimentation best practices for Discovery, from how tests are designed to how results get acted on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make Discovery data usable company-wide.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the creation of the datasets, documentation, and self-serve tooling that enable anyone at Faire to reliably leverage complex Discovery data in analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the steward of data enablement for S&amp;amp;A.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the tooling, operating model, and cross-functional relationships to ensure S&amp;amp;A has the right foundations to quickly and reliably drive impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create the systems and processes that enable a well run team.&lt;/strong&gt; Create the right systems to enable Discovery S&amp;amp;As to set the analytical roadmap, prioritize effectively, and scale themselves and their impact. Take what works well to level up the broader S&amp;amp;A team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Building -&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to attract, develop, and retain top talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Problem Solving -&lt;/strong&gt; World class at breaking down the most ambiguous problems and coordinating large teams to answer it. Can cut through the noise to get to the answer and coach their team to do the same. Clear, structured, and concise communicator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Business Intuition -&lt;/strong&gt; Can contextualize how insights fit into broader business goals. Ideally has deep understanding of marketplaces and/or discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivity &amp;amp; Ownership -&lt;/strong&gt; Identifies gaps in knowledge or the way we work and owns driving solutions forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics -&lt;/strong&gt; Has a strong technical toolkit. Can go deep on the hardest Discovery analyses and sets a high bar for analytical rigor and digging to the root.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional influence -&lt;/strong&gt; Strong collaborative partner to key stakeholders. Gets outcomes through partners without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Values -&lt;/strong&gt; Growth mindset, scrappy, adaptable, curious, low ego, and strong work ethic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
